      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `e81959eb7383b36ec243f65c03889e228329a85b600e923c8153e7c5a512864f--45100do004_2013.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2013\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | d14a744fcb600c794117f27ec5d3cc8f243e0164034fc00de14483c6d2e653e2 | missing |\n| \"Table_17\" | 5190ae95247d4669bf88d65982583ffbb1d3703f0e0d08ae8baac77a4dbd9099 | missing |\n| \"Table_18\" | c1da36d75246003ae854d41037802f23171a39ae32ba8be71cb8a38c756f28d8 | missing |\n| \"Table_19\" | 4871fd9028b0d5f28e0d122cee1421ee5a72248574e2a0a24f5771675f60e03a | missing |\n| \"Table_20\" | d5d4ca871d5af301fa0702cb01e517554455cf48ee655f6730af6671e7cf8010 | missing |\n| \"Table_21\" | cd65a3464fa68ab0d417e461024a0460b36bb87bb8dae3363a6b8ff07a47829e | missing |\n| \"Table_22\" | 6e287b916dc160ef575bcc9613301e253f60c9c2f0272478a7b176a6cb923f34 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
